                                                        @onclick="() => PrintReportExternal((it.fromtcode > 0 ? it.fromtcode : it.tcode).ToString())" @onclick:stopPropagation 
                                                        style="border: 1px solid #bae6fd; background: #e0f2fe; color: #0284c7; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.75rem; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
                                                    <i class="fas fa-print"></i>
                                                </button>
                                                <label class="re-row-img-btn" title="@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(it.image_path) ? "Attach Image for this Test" : $"Attached Image: {it.image_path}")" @onclick:stopPropagation 
                                                       style="cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 5px; background: @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(it.image_path) ? "#6366f1" : "#e0e7ff"); border: 1px solid @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(it.image_path) ? "#4f46e5" : "#c7d2fe"); transition: all 0.2s ease;">
                                                    <InputFile OnChange="@(e => UploadRowImage(e, it))" style="display: none;" accept="image/*,.pdf" />
                                                    <i class="fas fa-image" style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: @(!string.IsNullOrEmpty(it.image_path) ? "#ffffff" : "#4338ca");"></i>
                                                </label>
                                                <button class="re-dot-btn" title="Row Details" @onclick="() => OpenRowDetail(it)" @onclick:stopPropagation style="width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 0.75rem;">&#8230;</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            }
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            @if (IsDetailedNormalValuesVisible)
            {
                <!-- Right Panel (Normal Values for) -->
                <div class="re-panel-card re-right-panel" id="rp-drag-panel">
                <div class="re-rp-header" id="rp-drag-header">
                    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-sliders-h"></i> Normal Values for
                    </div>
                    <button class="re-btn-close-popup" @onclick="ToggleDetailedNormalValues" title="Close Panel">
                        <i class="fas fa-times"></i>
                    </button>
                </div>
                
                @if (SelectedRowEntry == null)
                {
                    <div style="padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.9rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; height: 300px;">
                        <i class="fas fa-info-circle" style="font-size: 2rem; color: #94a3b8;"></i>
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4;">Select a test row in the grid to view and edit normal values and settings.</p>
                    </div>
                }
                else
                {
                    <div class="re-rp-tabs">
                        <button class="re-rp-tab @(RightTab == "Settings" ? "active" : "")" @onclick="@(() => RightTab = "Settings")">
                            <i class="fas fa-cogs"></i> Settings
                        </button>
                        <button class="re-rp-tab @(RightTab == "Comments" ? "active" : "")" @onclick="@(() => RightTab = "Comments")">
                            <i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i> Comments
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    @if (RightTab == "Settings")
                    {
                        <div class="re-rp-content">
                            <!-- Section: Result Type -->
                            <div class="re-form-grid">
                                <label class="re-label">Result Type</label>
                                <select class="re-select" @bind="SidebarResultType">
                                    <option value="Text">Text</option>
                                    <option value="Text & Number">Text &amp; Number</option>
                                    <option value="Number">Number</option>
                                    <option value="Fixed Type">Fixed Type</option>
                                    <option value="Calculated Value">Calculated Value</option>
                                    <option value="Title">Title</option>
                                    <option value="SubTitle">SubTitle</option>
                                </select>
